-- Exercises EasyMetric P40-P44 on a 128x128 canvas. P44: :em/outline
-- cycles off/solid/shade (an edge-detect over the render); the outline
-- rides both the preview and the bake.
--
-- The canvas is named (:e em-canvas.png) up front so it is not a NoFile
-- scratch pad — otherwise creating the bake output view would replace it
-- (session add_view). P43: :em/bake creates an output view on demand and
-- stamps the rendered model into it; :em/probe reads the output by id and
-- the undo-roundtrip (stamp present -> :undo -> transparent) is the
-- digest's assertion.
--
-- P40 layout/carve/preview: :em/on, :em/box 20x16x24 (the splits, drawn
-- by the draw hook), the em-driver fills the quadrants, the shade hook
-- carves the live sheet, the render hook draws the preview pane.
--
-- P41 free rotation: :em/rotate spins the carved box; a static gap proves
-- the unchanged re-render adds no unique frames.
--
-- P42 texture/colour/shading: layer 0 is a textured left-half box (a
-- distinct colour per silhouette, so the triplanar per-face select reads
-- — top green, front teal, side purple); layer 1 is a flat-colored
-- right-half box (the union makes a full box, textured | colored down the
-- middle, topmost strip wins). :em/textured, :set easymetric/shade and
-- :set easymetric/dither give digest-distinct states; :em/status posts
-- the union voxel count and :em/scan the per-layer quadrant counts read
-- through view_layer_pixels (the non-active strip the API exists for).
--
-- ui/message stays on: the status/scan probes are the digest's job.
set ui/status = off
set ui/view-info = off
set ui/switcher = off
set ui/cursor = off
set ui/palette = off

set input/mouse = off

map o :em/on
map c :em/box 20 16 24

-- The silhouette fills are typed through the command line (digit keys
-- mis-bind args; letters are exhausted). Layer 0 (textured) gets a
-- distinct colour per view so the triplanar per-face select reads; layer
-- 1 (colored) only needs alpha, em/paint sets the flat fill.

map w :layer/add
map y :layer/set 1
map f :em/paint #cc8844
map q :em/textured

map a :em/rotate 30 0
map i :em/rotate 0 20
map m :em/reset
map s :set easymetric/shade = 1
map t :set easymetric/dither = 2

map p :em/status
map n :em/scan
map d :em/off
